    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 28 September 2005 the applicant’s lawyer applied to the Dupnitsa District Court for judicial review of the mayor’s decision... The Dupnitsa District Court gave judgment on 10 March 2006... the court dismissed the application"@en ;
